	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Liberasti fidem tuam, fili.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nunc <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>enim primum tuas literas cum tractatione d. <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><persName ref="p4037">Zanchi</persName> De cohercendis hereticis accepi, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>datas olim a te 6. iulii; ubi interea hae<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>serint, nescio.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Video et experior vanam et <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>fluxam fidem tabelliorum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Tu itaque vide, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quibus credas literas, eas maxime, quas putaveris <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>alicuius esse momenti.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Postremis obiurgavi te, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quod ex nundinis nihil scripsisses; iam <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>vero video nihil hic tua culpa, sed aliena esse peccatum, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/><foreign xml:lang="de">wiewol einer alle zyt flyssig luͦgen soll, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>wemm er die brieff vetruw.</foreign></s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Si tu cre<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>didisses nostris peplariis, dudum mihi fuis<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sent redditae; sed inde coniicio te habere adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>aliquid <foreign xml:lang="de">diner liederliche und hinlässige;</foreign> alio<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>qui potuisses nullo negotio his dare literas.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Du <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>thuͦst aber nüt zuͦ eim ding, biß es nitt böser ma<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>g werden; dann tränist und machst heini <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>troppff nahin.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Cuperem omnino scire, quis tibi <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tradiderit eas, quas tuis inclusisti; nam <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ex <placeName ref="l734">Phrisia</placeName> allatae sunt ad vos; non frustra <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>autem cupio scire, a quo acceperis etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Expecto, ut postulaveram, tuam ultimam ratio<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>cinationem de expensis ad 1. usque septembris, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ut sciat, quid relictum sit de 8 coronatis, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>quos miseram te proficiscente ad <persName ref="p505">Burcherum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>per <persName ref="p1227">Froschoverum</persName> nostrum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Dinem herren schrib ich, er sölle dich bekleyden <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>zur notturfft uff den wynter und nitt zum über<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>fluß oder hoffart; ich vermags nitt, wills ouch nitt.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Da luͦg, das du dich frugalem und erbar und ge<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>horsam erzeigist.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">Wider die notturfft bin ich <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>nitt.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Bruch die kleyder sparlich und suber.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Tractatio illa a te missa manca est et mendosa; <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>probo tamen tuam operam, sed requiro maiorem <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>diligentiam, et tu tantis sumptibus magno r<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>espondeas profectu.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Valemus per gratiam <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>dei omnes.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">D<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>ominus benedicat tibi et sit tibi <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>propitius.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Responde ad has et ad ultimas <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>meas, quas <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>misi per <persName ref="p20684">Spillerum</persName> et <persName ref="p8054">Bertschium</persName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Datae <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>25. <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>augusti anno 155<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>4.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Literas in <placeName ref="l734">Phrisiam</placeName> destinatas vide, ut diligenter <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>et fideliter procures per Gabrielem coriarium <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l267">Coloniensem</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Quod si ille diu adhuc mansurus <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>e<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>st <placeName ref="l491">Argentinae</placeName> nec recte ad nundinas et i<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>n <placeName ref="l734">Phrisia</placeName>m profecturus est, vide, ut literas des <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>d. <persName ref="p1227">Christophoro Froschovero</persName> obsecrans, ut diligenter <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>procuret <placeName ref="l157">Francforti</placeName>, vel da literas comitibus <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>Phrisiis, qui apud vos sunt; scribo enim ad matrem comi<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>tissam ipsorum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Literae <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>his inclusae sunt.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Iteru<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>m vale.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Scribe, quomodo procuraris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">D<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>ilecto meo filio <persName ref="p487">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName> in aedibus d. <persName ref="p505">Ioannis Burcheri</persName>, <placeName ref="l830">Angli</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentinae</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>